                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does Diwali drive of annual D2C revenue in India?</h3>
                                        <p>25-40% for many categories. Jewelry + fashion + F&B + gifting brands see 40-55% concentration.</p>
                                        <h3>When should Diwali planning start?</h3>
                                        <p>12-16 weeks before Diwali for serious campaigns. Creative + inventory + creator commitments + PR + corporate gifting outreach all need long lead time.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I focus on Big Billion Days / Great Indian Sale?</h3>
                                        <p>Depends on category. Fashion + electronics + home: essential. Beauty + jewelry: brand.com + Nykaa often preferred over marketplace price competition.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the ideal Diwali marketing budget concentration?</h3>
